# <%~ it.instance.name || it.instance.slug %>: Selection Report
<%
  /* Opens with the role summary so the report stands alone for a reader who has not seen the
     Requisition Brief — the only reason `role` is in this artefact's `requires` at all.
     Vetting records outcomes only; see modules/vetting.yaml for why the particulars are
     deliberately not modelled anywhere in this definition.

     v2 (#90): `selection.preferred-candidate` split into `candidate-name` (text) and
     `rationale` (markdown) — see modules/selection.yaml. `advertising.channels` and
     `vetting.checks-required` are now select/multiple: true, storing bullets exactly as
     `list` did, so the loops below are unchanged.

     v3 (#154): prints a warning when vetting reads Not cleared (the gate cannot restrict a
     select's values), and always shows the Conditions heading when the outcome is Cleared with
     conditions, with "— not stated —" when blank, so a missing condition is visible.
     `role.summary` is referenced `?` because it belongs to Requisition; it is still printed.
     `open-questions.process-gaps?` is in `requires` for authoring scope only and is printed in
     the Hire Record. `selection.unsuccessful` may be completed later, once reserve finalists
     are released after the offer is accepted. */
%>
# The role

<%~ na(it.modules.role.summary) %>

# Advertising

## Channels

<% it.modules.advertising.channels.forEach(function(item) { %>- <%~ item %>
<% }) %>
## Advertising period

<%~ na(it.modules.advertising.period) %>

## Response

<%~ na(it.modules.advertising.response) %>
<% if (it.modules.advertising.notes) { %>
## Notes

<%~ it.modules.advertising.notes %>
<% } %>
# Selection

## Shortlist

<%~ na(it.modules.selection.shortlist) %>

## Interviews

<%~ na(it.modules.selection.interviews) %>

## Candidate name

<%~ na(it.modules.selection['candidate-name']) %>

## Selection rationale

<%~ na(it.modules.selection.rationale) %>
<% if (it.modules.selection.unsuccessful) { %>
## Unsuccessful candidates

<%~ it.modules.selection.unsuccessful %>
<% } %>
# Vetting

## Checks required

<% it.modules.vetting['checks-required'].forEach(function(item) { %>- <%~ item %>
<% }) %>
## Outcome

<%~ na(it.modules.vetting.outcome) %>
<% if (it.modules.vetting.outcome === 'Not cleared') { %>
**Warning:** vetting did not clear this candidate. This stage should not be signed off.
<% } %>
<% if (it.modules.vetting.conditions || it.modules.vetting.outcome === 'Cleared with conditions') { %>
## Conditions

<%~ it.modules.vetting.conditions || '— not stated —' %>
<% } %>
<% if (it.modules['open-questions'].questions && it.modules['open-questions'].questions.length) { %>
# Open questions

<% it.modules['open-questions'].questions.forEach(function(item) { %>- <%~ item %>
<% }) %><% } %>
